        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8c0ed6d7-cbf9-3248-b6b3-7e6d376b6217",
                "word": "pastis",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b1b4ee53-6042-31eb-93cf-7f5e3b2e7cc2",
                        "entry_id": "8c0ed6d7-cbf9-3248-b6b3-7e6d376b6217",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Situation embarrassante, compliquée ou confuse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Provence"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9d34344-a0d1-4884-99e9-e7f3654b6bc9",
                                "sense_id": "b1b4ee53-6042-31eb-93cf-7f5e3b2e7cc2",
                                "text": "Tu ne veux tout de même pas que j'aille réclamer la Baronne à la police ! Tu te rends compte dans quel pastis elle risque de fourrer celle-là."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a88144f-51b4-452a-bef1-cf7b4f65d9b4",
                                "sense_id": "b1b4ee53-6042-31eb-93cf-7f5e3b2e7cc2",
                                "text": "Malgré la bonne volonté de Griffin, tout le monde nageait en plein pastis ; d’autant plus que Thelonius lui-même bouffait, toujours au même endroit, deux temps dans son solo, ne faisant bien sûr qu’accroître la consternation générale."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ca3167f0-b6ea-387c-a14b-b11f0c845df7",
                        "entry_id": "8c0ed6d7-cbf9-3248-b6b3-7e6d376b6217",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Boisson anisée typique du Sud de la France qui se boit augmentée d'eau fraîche."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4aebb17b-976c-4159-a5f6-55608b0f3fa1",
                                "sense_id": "ca3167f0-b6ea-387c-a14b-b11f0c845df7",
                                "text": "Parce que, les pastis, c'est comme les seins d'une femme, un c'est pas assez et trois c'est trop."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "464fef5e-5ebd-4723-a90f-b0494cf882a0",
                                "sense_id": "ca3167f0-b6ea-387c-a14b-b11f0c845df7",
                                "text": "Ça me fait peine de ne plus boire le pastis bien frais, sous les platanes, de ne plus jouer aux boules avec vous…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea6a0844-96b7-461b-b991-793fbafd9628",
                                "sense_id": "ca3167f0-b6ea-387c-a14b-b11f0c845df7",
                                "text": "Vous les féliciterez de ma part. Bravo à Frey et à ce marchand de pastis de Marseille, Pasqua je crois. Nous allons gagner les élections, et haut la main, je vous en fiche mon billet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "244d2a7b-3342-412c-b07e-06699d471598",
                                "sense_id": "ca3167f0-b6ea-387c-a14b-b11f0c845df7",
                                "text": "Certains plats restent à la carte toute l'année : frisée aux lardons, bouquet de crevettes sauce cocktail, gambas flambées au pastis, bavette d'aloyau à l'échalote, tête de veau sauce gribiche […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6ddc061-2262-4ad7-8b65-1d834f24f848",
                                "sense_id": "ca3167f0-b6ea-387c-a14b-b11f0c845df7",
                                "text": "Solubles dans le pastis pur, dont la concentration en alcool dépasse les 40 pour cent, les molécules d’anéthol sont insolubles dans le mélange eau-pastis."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4dc58374-5b7d-327b-b6c6-98061cbe9b80",
                        "entry_id": "8c0ed6d7-cbf9-3248-b6b3-7e6d376b6217",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gâteau composé de pâte feuilletée très fine, garni intérieurement de pommes ou de poires."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Quercy"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d82229f-e246-3ce9-8fff-405edc0606d8",
                        "entry_id": "8c0ed6d7-cbf9-3248-b6b3-7e6d376b6217",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Brioche parfumée à l’eau de fleur d'oranger, à la vanille ou au rhum."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Landes"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "edce2d61-86a5-3be0-b610-fcf4955975ca",
                        "entry_id": "8c0ed6d7-cbf9-3248-b6b3-7e6d376b6217",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Au handball, arrêt des deux mains du gardien lors duquel le ballon est conservé par celui-ci sans qu'il ait touché le sol."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a77696c-2607-43f6-a2af-835a107a211c",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c0ed6d7-cbf9-3248-b6b3-7e6d376b6217",
                        "source_sense_description": "Situation embrouillée",
                        "target_lang_word": "mess",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mess",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17e8d5f0-3f45-31e0-8c97-6a1dad5ee071",
                                        "entry_id": "b7b8c4a2-5a15-3b12-805e-c7c52b19c3a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a thing or group of things in a disagreeable, disorganised, or dirty state; hence a bad situation"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2185578-d484-4268-a4d1-2eac5d445f66",
                                                "sense_id": "17e8d5f0-3f45-31e0-8c97-6a1dad5ee071",
                                                "text": "No, look, I know that the place looks like a bit of a mess but it's actually a very delicate ecosystem. Everything is connected. It's like the rainforest. You change one thing, even the tiniest bit, and the whooole rainforest dies. You don't want the rainforest to die, do ya?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "871fb7e1-0ed6-43cc-8677-520e68ff1a34",
                                                "sense_id": "17e8d5f0-3f45-31e0-8c97-6a1dad5ee071",
                                                "text": "He made a mess of it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "802540a5-f9c6-4b60-aef0-fbf84389c5de",
                                                "sense_id": "17e8d5f0-3f45-31e0-8c97-6a1dad5ee071",
                                                "text": "My bedroom is such a mess; I need to tidy up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbfcda41-fb77-3349-9642-07c25981a2f2",
                                        "entry_id": "b7b8c4a2-5a15-3b12-805e-c7c52b19c3a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a large quantity or number"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c063f963-a6fd-4b26-aecd-c41c29e381a0",
                                                "sense_id": "cbfcda41-fb77-3349-9642-07c25981a2f2",
                                                "text": "Messerschmidts! A whole mess of Messerschmidts!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abd82953-6b94-47f0-8b2a-beebb76dfbd4",
                                                "sense_id": "cbfcda41-fb77-3349-9642-07c25981a2f2",
                                                "text": "My boss dumped a whole mess of projects on my desk today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c335ab7-51ee-42f0-b423-6555123f9526",
                                                "sense_id": "cbfcda41-fb77-3349-9642-07c25981a2f2",
                                                "text": "She brought back a mess of fish to fix for supper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "664f8288-dfa9-3989-8858-dd97b57fd71a",
                                        "entry_id": "b7b8c4a2-5a15-3b12-805e-c7c52b19c3a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "excrement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8700950d-e798-4b72-ae1b-61edf2266cf3",
                                                "sense_id": "664f8288-dfa9-3989-8858-dd97b57fd71a",
                                                "text": "There was dog mess all along the street."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0489eaf0-cc90-4c53-9876-0e40e5ba7032",
                                                "sense_id": "664f8288-dfa9-3989-8858-dd97b57fd71a",
                                                "text": "Did you hear that? It scared the mess out of me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccb0f9ab-1789-32a0-acf6-a34d34114612",
                                        "entry_id": "b7b8c4a2-5a15-3b12-805e-c7c52b19c3a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a person in a state of (especially emotional) turmoil or disarray; an emotional wreck"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e6b69db-aeb9-4eb0-babb-8f11d5ac860e",
                                                "sense_id": "ccb0f9ab-1789-32a0-acf6-a34d34114612",
                                                "text": "Between the pain and the depression, I'm a mess."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02e226da-81fc-48e0-ace8-5ce6567f591f",
                                                "sense_id": "ccb0f9ab-1789-32a0-acf6-a34d34114612",
                                                "text": "He's been a mess and a half ever since you excommunicated him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mess",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad63ae19-11f0-3933-bdac-c39c7f0c878c",
                                        "entry_id": "17fea31f-cc62-3600-a79d-be59a59d330c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make untidy or dirty.",
                                            "To make soiled by defecating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6776c784-3787-4b4b-94e4-71f7a2e429cf",
                                                "sense_id": "ad63ae19-11f0-3933-bdac-c39c7f0c878c",
                                                "text": "It seems like all you do is cry, eat, and mess your diapers!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4f23fc6-be5a-302e-a850-510f760078cf",
                                        "entry_id": "17fea31f-cc62-3600-a79d-be59a59d330c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make untidy or dirty.",
                                            "To make soiled by ejaculating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff8d4ff0-071f-3ed3-9492-35f24d508706",
                                        "entry_id": "17fea31f-cc62-3600-a79d-be59a59d330c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To throw into disorder or to ruin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8f1cc13-8101-4d2f-a65d-8e9e0d50397a",
                                                "sense_id": "ff8d4ff0-071f-3ed3-9492-35f24d508706",
                                                "text": "But it wasn't right to be messing another man's sleep with tidal waves that didn't belong to the other man."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a3c02ee-7e4e-36ef-accc-e8f265efb9ed",
                                        "entry_id": "17fea31f-cc62-3600-a79d-be59a59d330c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To interfere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "886563cf-79b4-436b-a507-ffc8bb363a9b",
                                                "sense_id": "1a3c02ee-7e4e-36ef-accc-e8f265efb9ed",
                                                "text": "This doesn't concern you. Don't mess."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mess",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd892050-7ef4-3af7-96fc-b9b79465bd33",
                                        "entry_id": "24aa1f25-8568-3c2f-a26d-c16140a2c7e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mass; a church service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28173a05-ca67-3227-b23e-e173491fbc0f",
                                        "entry_id": "24aa1f25-8568-3c2f-a26d-c16140a2c7e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A quantity of food set on a table at one time; provision of food for a person or party for one meal; also, the food given to an animal at one time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53323e7c-c0e1-4160-b244-70908e9024f5",
                                                "sense_id": "28173a05-ca67-3227-b23e-e173491fbc0f",
                                                "text": "c. 1555, Hugh Latimer, letter to one in prison for the profession of the Gospel\na mess of pottage"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60c672eb-9ccf-4f1c-8cb2-b764d3dbdcfb",
                                                "sense_id": "28173a05-ca67-3227-b23e-e173491fbc0f",
                                                "text": "At their savoury dinner set / Of herbs and other country messes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e688dd01-963f-4b2b-ada6-22625cb6f512",
                                                "sense_id": "28173a05-ca67-3227-b23e-e173491fbc0f",
                                                "text": "[Curry] consists of meat, fish, fruit, or vegetables, cooked with a quantity of bruised spices and turmeric […]; and a little of this gives a flavour to a large mess of rice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90594def-2021-39d3-a9a3-61ea95e484dc",
                                        "entry_id": "24aa1f25-8568-3c2f-a26d-c16140a2c7e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A number of persons who eat together, and for whom food is prepared in common, especially military personnel who eat at the same table."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "collective"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0c9f0dd-a25d-462f-8441-2fa2e65f9054",
                                                "sense_id": "90594def-2021-39d3-a9a3-61ea95e484dc",
                                                "text": "the wardroom mess"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3da68ff3-2668-4278-b3cd-0dc58969ae3d",
                                                "sense_id": "90594def-2021-39d3-a9a3-61ea95e484dc",
                                                "text": "But that our Feaſts / In euery Meſſe, haue folly; and the Feeders / Digeſt with a Cuſtome,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b51aeec-70ae-30ed-a7ad-c512ff354601",
                                        "entry_id": "24aa1f25-8568-3c2f-a26d-c16140a2c7e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A building or room in which mess is eaten."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00bc8a06-cc7a-40d8-a3df-356b1399a0f7",
                                                "sense_id": "9b51aeec-70ae-30ed-a7ad-c512ff354601",
                                                "text": "The police mess had formerly been a maternity home for the wives of the Sultans of the state. Faded and tatty, peeling, floorboards eaten and unpolished, its philoprogenitive glory was a memory only."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "787b1025-9cd0-3178-b35e-7d7e3ebc7d73",
                                        "entry_id": "24aa1f25-8568-3c2f-a26d-c16140a2c7e1",
                                        "glosses": [
